                    XenoRPG to Hack & Slash key convertor

This utility will convert your XenoRPG.reg file into a Hack&Slash.license
file.  Execute it from the same directory as your XenoRPG.reg file.  It
will create a Hack&Slash.license file.  Put this in your main Hack&Slash
directory and you're ready to roll.

This is a 1 time utility.  You may now throw it away.

Changes:
v1.1 11-28-92
-Recompiled with NoUnsignedChars, was causing X2H to think some people's
 XenoRPG.reg files were invalid.
